  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avfallshantering fas II Albanien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Waste Management ph II Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering av en internationell teknisk r&#xE5;dgivare i  avfallshantering vid premi&#xE4;rministerns (PM) kansli samt en fond p&#xE5; 2msek f&#xF6;r upphandling av korttidskonsulter f&#xF6;r specifika uppdrag. Det &#xE4;r en personlig r&#xE5;dgivare till PM f&#xF6;r att bist&#xE5; att utveckla en strategi f&#xF6;r hur man ska genomf&#xF6;ra den nationella avfallsstrategi som antogs 2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding of an international technical adviser (TA) in Solid Waste (SW) management at the Prime Minister&apos;s Office (PMO) as well as a small fund (2msek) for procurement of short term TA for specific assignments. It is a personal adviser to the PM to assist him to develop a strategy on how to implement the &quot;National solid waste strategy&quot; adopted in 2011.</narrative>
  </description>
